The sheet now shows a "Total yield" line with the other sheet totals: everyone's yield added together, leaving out anyone whose yield shows as "n/a". The automated test passes (`bin/e2e`); with its sample data the total comes to 1208.

The change is only in `src/main/frontend/src/app/features/people/people.ts`. The server already worked out each person's yield, so nothing on the server or in the stored data had to change. I added:
- the "Total yield" line, tagged `rollup-total-yield` as the test expects;
- the sum itself, written the same way as the existing totals (haul, pivot and so on);
- a one-line description in the file's header comment, alongside the other total rules.

